Package: tn5bias
Type: Package
Title: Tn5 sequence bias correction for ATAC-seq
Version: 0.99.4
Date: 2026-10-19
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pierre-Luc", "Germain", email="pierre-luc.germain@hest.ethz.ch",
            role=c("cre","aut"), comment=c(ORCID="0000-0003-3418-4218")))
Description:
  Tn5, the enzyme used in tagmentation-based technologies such as ATAC-seq, has a characteristic sequence bias. This packages computes a per-nucleotide Tn5 sequence bias for given DNA sequences, based on stranded 10-mer bias pre-computed using SELMA (Hu et al., 2022) on naked human DNA (but should be applicable to other species). The bias can then be used to correct ATAC coverage signal.
